<header>
  <nav class="wrap">
    <a href="#top" class="brand" aria-label="BTA home">
      <!-- Logo is embedded in the page, so no separate image file is needed. -->
      <img class="logo" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="BTA logo" onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';">
      <span class="mark">BTA</span>
      <span class="name">Business Technology Association</span>
    </a>
    <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false">≡</button>
    <div class="navlinks" id="navlinks">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#board">Executive Board</a>
      <a href="#events">Events</a>
      <a href="#join">Join</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <h1 class="title">Where <span class="accent">business</span> meets the <span class="accent">circuit</span>.</h1>
      <p class="lede">The Business Technology Association connects Kennesaw State students who want to understand how technology moves markets, through workshops, company speaker series, and a network built by students who'll build tomorrow's companies.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#join" class="btn">Become a Member</a>
        <a href="#events" class="btn ghost">See Events Calendar</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="stat"><b>50+</b><span>Active members</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><b>12</b><span>Average events per semester</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><b>5</b><span>Industry partners</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="trace-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="trace" viewBox="0 0 400 400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path class="trace-line" d="M40 60 H160 V140 H280 V60 H360" />
        <path class="trace-line b" d="M40 200 H120 V280 H40" />
        <circle class="node" cx="40" cy="60" r="5" style="animation-delay:.4s"/>
        <circle class="node" cx="280" cy="60" r="5" style="animation-delay:1.1s"/>
        <circle class="node" cx="360" cy="60" r="5" style="animation-delay:1.6s"/>
        <circle class="node" cx="40" cy="200" r="5" style="animation-delay:.7s"/>
        <circle class="node" cx="40" cy="280" r="5" style="animation-delay:1.3s"/>
        <line class="ledger-line" x1="20" y1="330" x2="380" y2="330"/>
        <line class="ledger-line" x1="20" y1="350" x2="380" y2="350"/>
        <line class="ledger-line" x1="20" y1="370" x2="380" y2="370"/>
        <line class="ledger-line" x1="120" y1="315" x2="120" y2="385"/>
        <line class="ledger-line" x1="240" y1="315" x2="240" y2="385"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Who we are</div>
      <h2>Fluent in balance sheets and back-ends.</h2>
      <p>BTA exists for students who don't want to choose between the boardroom and the terminal. We build the skills, connections, and hands-on experience that sit at the intersection of both.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-card reveal">
        <span class="idx">01 / MISSION</span>
        <h3>Bridge two worlds</h3>
        <p>We help members build fluency in both business strategy and the technical tools that now run every industry, from finance to product to operations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-card reveal">
        <span class="idx">02 / COMMUNITY</span>
        <h3>A network that lasts</h3>
        <p>Small enough that everyone's known by name, big enough to open doors. Our members support each other well past graduation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-card reveal">
        <span class="idx">03 / EXPERIENCE</span>
        <h3>Learn from industry</h3>
        <p>Executive speaker series, company visits, and career workshops put members in the room with the people hiring in business technology.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

